WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.327
Ringo looked out the window.

2
00:00:09.328 --> 00:00:12.369
"That's Nitro," Bot said.

3
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:17.813
A sign floated nearby.

4
00:00:17.814 --> 00:00:21.259
"There's a bike race today," Ringo said.

5
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:24.875
"Nitro has lots of races," Bot said.

6
00:00:24.876 --> 00:00:28.525
"Winners get prizes."

7
00:00:28.526 --> 00:00:31.957
Bot's light blinked.

8
00:00:31.958 --> 00:00:36.092
"Are you okay, Bot?" Ringo asked.

9
00:00:36.093 --> 00:00:50.968
"I'm fine," she said.

10
00:00:50.969 --> 00:00:58.605
Bot landed the spaceship.

11
00:00:58.606 --> 00:01:13.353
They went to Robo Mart.

12
00:01:13.354 --> 00:01:20.583
A clerk sat behind a counter.

13
00:01:20.584 --> 00:01:27.374
"My robot needs a booster," Ringo said.

14
00:01:27.375 --> 00:01:30.011
"Sorry," the clerk said.

15
00:01:30.012 --> 00:01:33.105
"We're out of boosters right now.

16
00:01:33.106 --> 00:01:35.856
I'll have more this afternoon."

17
00:01:35.857 --> 00:01:46.601
Ringo sighed. "We'll come back."

18
00:01:46.602 --> 00:01:51.544
Bot followed Ringo outside.

19
00:01:51.545 --> 00:01:55.665
"Bot is really slow today," Ringo thought.

20
00:01:55.666 --> 00:02:01.387
"Maybe the booster will help."

21
00:02:01.388 --> 00:02:12.830
Ringo and Bot went to Race School.

22
00:02:12.831 --> 00:02:32.955
Racing bikes zoomed all over.

23
00:02:32.956 --> 00:02:35.984
"I'm Gaston," a coach said.

24
00:02:35.985 --> 00:02:39.529
"I work at Race School."

25
00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:42.791
Ringo smiled. "I'm Ringo.

26
00:02:42.792 --> 00:02:45.118
I'm from Space Patrol.

27
00:02:45.119 --> 00:02:49.650
We're here to find the missing Astro bike."

28
00:02:49.651 --> 00:02:52.813
"Is that your robot?" Gaston asked.

29
00:02:52.814 --> 00:02:55.482
Ringo nodded. "Her name is—"

30
00:02:55.483 --> 00:02:57.473
Err! Clunk!

31
00:02:57.474 --> 00:02:59.800
Bot's light flicked off.

32
00:02:59.801 --> 00:03:02.699
She fell over. Bang!

33
00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:08.084
Ringo gasped. "Bot!"

